{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>Within it.</b> In its middle, like 'ועץ החיים בתוך הגן' — it proceeds to explain how." "The work of <b>weaving.</b> From the time of its weaving its opening shall be made in the middle of the garment. <b>It shall not be torn.</b> An opening, like 'וקרע לו חלוני.' This means the neck opening shall not be opened at the time of the garment's preparation, but rather at the time of weaving they leave in it a neck opening."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:57.586638696Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}